{"id":"vod_bf_40869","vodId":"40869","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"学园默示录","name_cn":"学园默示录","date":"2010-01-01","year":"2010","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"更新至第12集","images":{"common":"https://img.bfzypic.com/upload/vod/20230424-42/663e94e0d348e50150b12ab28a68a426.jpg"},"summary":"立藤美学园，仅仅因为一个入侵者——“它们”，而化作了地狱的坩埚！“它们”袭击人，咬人，产生出新的“它们”席卷了整个学园。在化成恶魔的世界的学园内，小室孝和青梅竹马宫本丽、朋友井豪永，暂时去避难。但是，为了保护丽而被“它们”咬的永却变成了“它们”……剩下来的两人，与其他幸存者，同级同学高城沙耶、平野户田、剑道部主将毒岛冴子、校医鞠川静香汇合，下定决心逃出学园！他们有办法活下来吗！？","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2025-04-02 20:30:34","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"OVA","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf5.com/video/xueyuanmoshilu/OVA/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf4.com/video/xueyuanmoshilu/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf5.com/video/xueyuanmoshilu/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/xueyuanmoshilu/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/xueyuanmoshilu/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/xueyuanmoshilu/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/xueyuanmoshilu/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf4.com/video/xueyuanmoshilu/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf5.com/video/xueyuanmoshilu/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf4.com/video/xueyuanmoshilu/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/xueyuanmoshilu/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/xueyuanmoshilu/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/xueyuanmoshilu/第12集/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:48:51.769Z"}